---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Statement — Avonce Construction Group" navLight={true}>
  <main class="legal-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Statement</h1>
        <p class="date-updated">Last Updated: May 14, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Body -->
    <section class="legal-body">
      <div class="legal-container">

        <p class="intro-text">
          At Avonce Construction Group, Inc., we are committed to maintaining the trust and confidence of our partners, employees, and website visitors. This Privacy Statement explains how we collect, use, and protect your data in accordance with the Florida Information Protection Act (FIPA).
        </p>

        <!-- Section 01 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 01</p>
          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We only collect information that you voluntarily provide to us or that is necessary for the operation of our professional services:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Personal Identification:</strong> Name, email address, and phone number when you contact our Orlando office at 407-270-4808 or use our online forms.</li>
            <li><strong>Employment Data:</strong> Professional history and contact details provided via the "Join Our Team" section.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, and usage patterns collected through first-party cookies to optimize our site's performance. We do not use third-party tracking or advertising cookies.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 02 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 02</p>
          <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>Your data is used strictly for professional and operational purposes:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>To provide trade specialty services (Framing, Finishes, and Exterior Building Systems).</li>
            <li>To communicate with General Contractor partners regarding project coordination and schedule certainty.</li>
            <li>To process employment applications for our leadership and field crews.</li>
            <li>To ensure compliance with safety and industry standards.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 03 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 03</p>
          <h2>Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this statement, or as required by applicable law and contractual obligations.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Employment application data is retained for a maximum of <strong>two (2) years.</strong></li>
            <li>Contact and project-related data is retained for a maximum of <strong>seven (7) years</strong> in accordance with standard construction industry record-keeping requirements.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 04 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 04</p>
          <h2>Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
          <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We only share data with third parties when:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>It is required to fulfill a project-related contract.</li>
            <li>It is necessary for website hosting and maintenance.</li>
            <li>It is required by law or to protect the safety and integrity of our operations.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 05 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 05</p>
          <h2>Security Standards</h2>
          <p>Consistent with The Avonce Way, we apply a disciplined approach to data security. We implement administrative and technical safeguards to protect your personal information against unauthorized access or disclosure as required by Florida law.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 06 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 06</p>
          <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Our website and services are intended solely for business and professional use. We do not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under the age of 13. If we become aware that we have inadvertently collected such information, we will promptly delete it.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 07 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 07</p>
          <h2>Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Review the information we have about you.</li>
            <li>Request a correction to your data.</li>
            <li>Request the deletion of your personal information, subject to legal record-keeping requirements.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 08 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 08</p>
          <h2>Changes to This Statement</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to update this Privacy Statement at any time. When changes are made, we will revise the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this statement periodically. Continued use of our website following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated statement.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 09 -->
        <div class="policy-section">
          <p class="section-number">Section 09</p>
          <h2>Contact Information</h2>
          <p>For questions regarding this statement, please contact us at our regional headquarters:</p>
          <address>
            <strong>Avonce Construction Group, Inc.</strong><br />
            8810 Commodity Cir, Suite 29<br />
            Orlando, FL 32819<br />
            <a href="tel:4072704808">(407) 270-4808</a><br />
            <a href="mailto:zef@avonceconstruction.com">zef@avonceconstruction.com</a>
          </address>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: #fcfcfc;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .legal-hero {
    background: #121212;
    padding-top: 96px;
  }

  .legal-hero-inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 100px 72px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #e6a523;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    line-height: 110%;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .date-updated {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Body ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .legal-body {
    padding: 80px 0 120px;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 100px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  /* Intro */
  .intro-text {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 180%;
    color: #3a3a3a;
    margin: 0 0 56px;
    padding-bottom: 56px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
  }

  /* Policy Sections */
  .policy-section {
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .section-number {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #e6a523;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-section h2 {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 130%;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #121212;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 175%;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .policy-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .policy-section ul li {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 175%;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .policy-section ul li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #e6a523;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .policy-section ul li strong {
    color: #121212;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Address block */
  address {
    font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 190%;
    color: #4a4a4a;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border-left: 3px solid #e6a523;
    background: #fafafa;
  }

  address strong {
    color: #121212;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  address a {
    color: #121212;
    text-decoration: underline;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  address a:hover {
    color: #e6a523;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .legal-hero-inner,
    .legal-container {
      padding-left: 60px;
      padding-right: 60px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-hero-inner {
      padding: 60px 40px 48px;
    }
    .legal-container {
      padding: 0 40px;
    }
    .legal-body {
      padding: 60px 0 80px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .legal-hero-inner {
      padding: 48px 24px 40px;
    }
    .legal-container {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .policy-section h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
